    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Yehova nyutho ira kumeni: man, nen, ecwio bonyo i thekri mi loth mi giratwia ma cen; man, nen, en e giratwia ma cen yo ng’ei nyar m’ubimo nyaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre nia, kinde ma gidaru camu lum mi ng’om, alund awacu kumae, E Rwoth Yehova, akwei, wek woko: Yakobo bicungo nenedi? kum e nok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova loko cwinye pi maeni kumae: Ebibedo nuti ngo, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Yehova nyutho kumeni ira: man, nen, Rwoth Yehova lwong’o pi piembri ma ku mac; e ewang’u pi ma dit, man eyenyo ewang’ ng’om kot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alund awacu kumae, E Rwoth Yehova, weki, akwei: Yakobo bicungo nenedi? kum en e nok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova loko cwinye pi maeni: Maeni bende bibedo nuti ngo, Rwoth Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyutho ira kumeni: man, nen, Rwoth ucungo i ng’et gang’kidi ma jutimo ku thol m’atira, ku thol m’atira i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova wacu ira kumae, Amos, ineno ang’o? Man awacu kumae, Thol m’atira. Rwoth ulund uwacu kumae, Nen, abiketho thol m’atira i kind dhanu para Israel; abikadhu akadha kendo ngo mange kud i ng’etgi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ka ma malu pa Isak bibedo ni uvuru, man jubidwoko kamaleng’ mir Israel ni uvuru; e abiai kum ot pa Yeroboam ku palamularu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia ma jalam mi Beth-el ulund uoro kwenda ba Yeroboam m’ubimo mir Israel, ewacu kumae, Amos uthubo ali i kumi i kind ot mir Israel: ng’om copo ciro lembe pare ceke ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Amos uwacu kumae, Yeroboam bitho ku palamularu, e jubiyaku Israel kud i ng’om pare andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia bende wacu ni Amos kumae, In i jaeulembe, cidhi, ring cen i ng’om Yuda, man icam kwen kuca, ieu lembe de kuca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento kud ieu lembe mange kendo i Beth-el; kum en e kamaleng’ p’ubimo, man en e odker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amos ulund uloko lembe, man ewacu ni Amazia kumae, An a jabila ngo, kadok wod jabila de ngo; ento an a jakwac, man jalwer kum duru; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Yehova gama ku tok udul rombe, man Yehova wacu ira kumae, Cidhi, cu ni dhanu para Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono winj lembe pa Yehova: Iwacu kumae, Kud ieu kum Israel, man kud iketh lembe peri podh kum ot pa Isak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno Yehova wacu kumae: Cegi bibedo won asara i adhura, man woti ku nyigi bipodho ku palamularu, man jubipoko ng’om peri ku wang’piny; man in giri ibitho i ng’om m’ucido, e jubiyaku Israel kud i ng’om pare andha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
